            "contentType": "STORY",
            "title": "Crawford United (CRAW.A): Margin Gains Challenge Bearish Growth Narratives Despite Weak Forward Outlook",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Crawford United (CRAW.A) delivered standout earnings growth, with profits rising at an average annual rate of 24.8% over the last five years and a striking 36.7% gain in the most recent year. Net profit margins improved to 10.1% from 8.8%, highlighting efficient operations. However, analyst projections now point to a 19.8% annual decline in earnings over the next three years, paired with much slower revenue growth of just 1.1% each year. This is well below the US market\u2019s 10.5% average. The...",
